+## 2. Phase 1 Root Causes & Optimizations Applied (`spec/models` + Global Config)
+
+1. **Global `ActiveRecord.verbose_query_logs = true` Leak**:
+   - `spec/models/concerns/status/fetch_replies_concern_spec.rb:6` set `ActiveRecord.verbose_query_logs = true` at the class-definition level of `RSpec.describe`.
+   - Removed `ActiveRecord.verbose_query_logs = true` and set `config.log_level = ENV.fetch('RAILS_LOG_LEVEL', 'warn')` in `config/environments/test.rb`.
+
+2. **Global `Sidekiq.testing!(:inline)` & Unnecessary `TriggerWebhookWorker` / Mailer Execution**:
+   - Set `config.active_job.queue_adapter = :test` in `config/environments/test.rb` so emails are only rendered on demand inside `capture_emails` blocks.
+   - Changed `spec/rails_helper.rb` to use `Sidekiq.testing!(:fake)` by default for `type: :model` (with `:inline_workers` tag opt-in).
+
+3. **Paperclip Post-Processing Overhead (`spec/support/paperclip.rb`)**:
+   - Added `PaperclipTestOptimization` in `spec/support/paperclip.rb` to skip `post_process` in model specs unless tagged with `:paperclip_processing` (while keeping `check_validity?` active).
+
+4. **Devise BCrypt Digest Memoization (`spec/rails_helper.rb`)**:
+   - Memoized `Devise::Encryptor.digest` by `[klass.pepper, klass.stretches, password]` in `spec/rails_helper.rb`.
+
+5. **Redis Cleanup (`spec/rails_helper.rb`)**:
+   - Replaced `redis.del(redis.keys)` with `redis.flushdb`.
+
+6. **Shared Setup Restructuring (`let_it_be` / `before_all`)**:
+   - Enabled `test_prof/recipes/rspec/let_it_be` with `default_modifiers[:reload] = true` in `spec/rails_helper.rb` and converted repetitive `let!` / `before` database setups to `let_it_be` / `before_all` in the slowest model specs.
+
+### `spec/models` Results After Phase 1
+- **Wall Time**: **~28.4 seconds** (down from **154.5 seconds** — **81.6% faster / 5.4x speedup**)
+- **Examples**: 1,795 examples, 0 failures
+
